02:11:04.210 --> 02:11:10.980
If you could put a quote, a question, a phrase,
a word, anything on a billboard, metaphorically

02:11:10.980 --> 02:11:14.960
speaking, to get it in front of millions or
billions of people, what might you put on

02:11:14.960 --> 02:11:15.960
such a billboard?

02:11:15.960 --> 02:11:18.520
Justin Gary: Yes, I'm excited to get this
one.

02:11:18.520 --> 02:11:19.520
I had anticipated it might come up.

02:11:19.520 --> 02:11:20.980
I've listened to a lot of the podcasts.

02:11:20.980 --> 02:11:28.060
I'm going to use one as a mantra for myself,
which I say to myself every day, which is:

02:11:28.060 --> 02:11:32.630
"Cultivate comfort with uncertainty and impermanence."

02:11:32.630 --> 02:11:34.590
Cultivate comfort with uncertainty and impermanence.

02:11:34.590 --> 02:11:39.449
It sounds maybe a little woo-woo to people,
but in reality it's so much of what we do,

02:11:39.449 --> 02:11:42.969
and we talked about this a little bit earlier,
is because we're afraid that we don't know

02:11:42.969 --> 02:11:43.969
what's going to happen.

02:11:43.969 --> 02:11:47.670
We're afraid we're going to lose something,
and the truth is, you never know what's going

02:11:47.670 --> 02:11:49.699
to happen, and you're going to lose everything.

02:11:49.699 --> 02:11:51.869
We're all going to die.

02:11:51.869 --> 02:11:58.679
If you can just be okay in that space of not
knowing, the control freak piece of it, the

02:11:58.679 --> 02:12:02.340
staying as a lawyer or a safer path, and be
okay with the fact that things are not going

02:12:02.340 --> 02:12:07.190
to stay the same all the time, then life gets
so much easier, whether that be your creative

02:12:07.190 --> 02:12:11.219
path, or your relationships, or anything,
that has been one of the most powerful things

02:12:11.219 --> 02:12:14.280
for me personally, so I'd hope to share that
message.

